<title>UK: Credit Suisse sets Swiss government bond warrants.</title>
<headline>Credit Suisse sets Swiss government bond warrants.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crdit Suisse (Zurich) said it has issued two million American-style call and put warrants in two equal tranches, on the 4.50 percent Eidenossenschaft April 8,</p>
<p>2006 bond.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 15.NOV.96-15.MAY.97   PAYDATE	14.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  104.50 PCT</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT	  ISSUE	STRIKE	PREMIUM     GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	     0.96 CHF   105 PCT     2.8 PCT     97 X</p>
<p> PUT		1.08 CHF   102 PCT     2.2 PCT     109 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
